Z||000000||LuckyTheyWereEverMade||03-02-2001||12:29 AM||||I am building a Fiero web site which is dedicated to 1984 2m4 Fieros.    <P>I would like to add links for those interested in the Indy pace car replicas.  <P>What sites would you recommend?<P>also, is there a difference between the 2m4 and indy exhaust systems?   ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Songman||03-02-2001||01:44 AM||||I am doing an Indy page on out TN Fiero site at <A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros." TARGET=_blank>http://members.home.com/tnfieros.</A> <P>Yes, there is a difference in the exhaust. The Indy has two outlets on each side. The 2M4 only has outlets on one side. Not sure if it is one outlet or two. I have an 84 SE but haven't looked at it in so long I can't remember. My 88 coupe has two outlets on one side.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
